        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105120/extras/9e6f930f3504264b156a9e55ab0f2e02.poster.avif?t=1780604414\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105120/extras/9e6f930f3504264b156a9e55ab0f2e02.webm?t=1780604414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105120/extras/9e6f930f3504264b156a9e55ab0f2e02.mp4?t=1780604414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Omni-Dissonance]: 3I/ATLAS is a zero-gravity experience about exploring small sections of a vast, alien structure. You've awoken, after your crew has vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift through its otherworldly architecture to collect the black boxes containing their neural data and read fragmented clues to what drew them here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no going back, only deeper in. Find your own solace in the quiet terror of isolation and the haunting pull of the unknown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105120/extras/b5f0c2f167a3ab993ac5add5d09960a4.avif?t=1780604414\" width=1164 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- True zero-gravity: Flip, roll, and navigate in complete freedom of movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Neo-retro aesthetic: A familiar but new aesthetic that does not directly replicate a single style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Short runtime: Around an hour of gameplay. With objectives locations that shift each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mysterious Megastructure: An immense, disorienting labyrinth that is both tranquil and ominous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lurking Presence: Avoid the entity that stalks the twisting halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105120/extras/a0fedc7684e61af6977e1e1aea7b69b8.avif?t=1780604414\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who this game is for:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Games as an art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cryptic meta-narrative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Self-motivated exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Megastructures</p>",
