isorienting labyrinth that is both tranquil and ominous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lurking Presence: Avoid the entity that stalks the twisting halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105120/extras/a0fedc7684e61af6977e1e1aea7b69b8.avif?t=1780604414\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who this game is for:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Games as an art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cryptic meta-narrative</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Self-motivated exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Megastructures</p>",
